  "summary_en": "Commission staff working document assessing progress by the EU and Member States on 58 consolidated 2025 Digital Decade recommendations across 21 areas. Most show limited or notable progress. It covers AI infrastructure, cybersecurity, connectivity, skills and digital identity, and says the priority is implementation at Member State level. It has no robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Of 42 consolidated recommendations, 19 show limited progress, 22 notable and 1 significant (EU Digital Identity Wallet).",
   "The EuroHPC JU is rolling out 19 AI factories and AI gigafactories, with Apply AI Strategy and EDIH/TEF support.",
   "Information integrity and green-digital transition recommendations show only limited progress.",
   "Only 19 Member States had fully transposed NIS2; the Commission proposed CSA2.",
   "The priority for 2026-2027 is implementation at national level."
